{"id":"acogcbsxp7p1kmly6nv2kw2ci","title":"质谱技术改变现代分析科学","originalTitle":"PPT分享 质谱技术改变现代分析科学","summary":"质谱技术是现代分析科学的重要基础技术，通过将物质转化为带电离子并根据质荷比分离检测，获得物质的质量、组成、结构及同位素信息。该技术经历了从物理学实验装置到高分辨率分析平台的巨大转变，推动了现代化学、物理学和生命科学的进步，改变了地球科学研究中的认识。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1561618"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:08:52.361Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:08:52.361Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":19,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}